(6946934, 1047397, 43191, '<td valign="top">Just heard the story of Eternity on the footpaths and roads on Sunday :) Nice</td>', 'Just heard the story of Eternity on the footpaths and roads on Sunday :) Nice', '2013-01-02 00:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946940, 1047470, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is so well-known that if I were to take it on, I have to make sure it was almost perfect.<br/> <br/>I think if you''d had someone looking through the viewfinder, that it would be easier to tell the hand model when the wrist met the drawn pencil tip.<br/> <br/> <br/>Also, there''s something awkward about the real pencil near the writing tip... like a chunk out of it or something.<br/> <br/> <br/>Still, I love the idea of it... and it made me smile.<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'This is so well-known that if I were to take it on, I have to make sure it was almost perfect. I think if you''d had someone looking through the viewfinder, that it would be easier to tell the hand model when the wrist met the drawn pencil tip.  Also, there''s something awkward about the real pencil near the writing tip... like a chunk out of it or something.  Still, I love the idea of it... and it made me smile.   (commenting only)', '2013-01-02 00:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946941, 1047087, 86447, '<td valign="top">FUN image!<br/>Love the background not being all one color.<br/> <br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'FUN image!Love the background not being all one color.  (commenting only)', '2013-01-02 00:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946945, 1047132, 86447, '<td valign="top">Indeed.    I love that sharp pen... not thrilled about the shadow of the pen, but love the writing out of focus in the background.<br/> <br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'Indeed.    I love that sharp pen... not thrilled about the shadow of the pen, but love the writing out of focus in the background.  (commenting only)', '2013-01-02 00:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946949, 1047397, 152252, '<td valign="top">Great tones, very nice shadow, sharpness on the pen, caligraphy... Love the composition.</td>', 'Great tones, very nice shadow, sharpness on the pen, caligraphy... Love the composition.', '2013-01-02 00:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946951, 1047555, 86447, '<td valign="top">Wonderful art!<br/> <br/>I think the image would have drawn me in more if it were more... uhh... maybe intimate.<br/> <br/>If the items were closer together... and not so much space about the outside of them... <br/> <br/>The coffee cup isn''t necessary to the story, in my opinion, and the case is set almost too perfectly.   I''d love to see this a bit more... uhh... "casual" and intimate.<br/> <br/>And, I''d like to see more of your drawn art (not in the photo... but that, too... in real life... do you have a website?)<br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'Wonderful art! I think the image would have drawn me in more if it were more... uhh... maybe intimate. If the items were closer together... and not so much space about the outside of them...  The coffee cup isn''t necessary to the story, in my opinion, and the case is set almost too perfectly.   I''d love to see this a bit more... uhh... "casual" and intimate. And, I''d like to see more of your drawn art (not in the photo... but that, too... in real life... do you have a website?) (commenting only)', '2013-01-02 00:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
