(6947285, 1047557, 77196, '<td valign="top">To me, this either has a focus issue, or a depth of field too narrow issue. Neat concept, but it rather relies on the title to clarify your intent. It seems that the in-focus area ends just before the middle of the circle, leaving the middle (where the eye is drawn) and beyond slightly OOF.</td>', 'To me, this either has a focus issue, or a depth of field too narrow issue. Neat concept, but it rather relies on the title to clarify your intent. It seems that the in-focus area ends just before the middle of the circle, leaving the middle (where the eye is drawn) and beyond slightly OOF.', '2013-01-02 09:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
