(6947723, 1047512, 37999, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. the melting cranyons in the hand and driping to the table is great. You used a good color so it is bright and inviting! You also made the crayons in the background look good without them being too distracting. Good Job. 9</td>', 'I really like this photo. the melting cranyons in the hand and driping to the table is great. You used a good color so it is bright and inviting! You also made the crayons in the background look good without them being too distracting. Good Job. 9', '2013-01-02 19:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6947725, 1047547, 37999, '<td valign="top">Snow is very hard to photograph correctly. All I see here is a stick laying on the ground that most likely was not used to write 2013 as the numbers are thick and precise and most likely made with a finger and gone over to make it look readable. Maybe using the tree branch in action would have worked better? 3</td>', 'Snow is very hard to photograph correctly. All I see here is a stick laying on the ground that most likely was not used to write 2013 as the numbers are thick and precise and most likely made with a finger and gone over to make it look readable. Maybe using the tree branch in action would have worked better? 3', '2013-01-02 19:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6947726, 1047536, 37999, '<td valign="top">hmmmmmm... This is very interesting and visually makes you think. With the lack of color you are using it makes it feel like and old photograph, however the pen is not and the paper is not and that throws me for a loop and makes the photo feel off to me. 5</td>', 'hmmmmmm... This is very interesting and visually makes you think. With the lack of color you are using it makes it feel like and old photograph, however the pen is not and the paper is not and that throws me for a loop and makes the photo feel off to me. 5', '2013-01-02 19:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
