(6950050, 1047486, 114225, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea and execution.</td>', 'Excellent idea and execution.', '2013-01-05 21:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950051, 1047429, 114225, '<td valign="top">That''s a creative take. I don''t know that I would call it writing, but I will give the benefit of doubt.</td>', 'That''s a creative take. I don''t know that I would call it writing, but I will give the benefit of doubt.', '2013-01-05 21:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950052, 1047536, 114225, '<td valign="top">This works well.</td>', 'This works well.', '2013-01-05 21:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950054, 1047208, 114225, '<td valign="top">Creepy. Like a horror film message to the next victim.</td>', 'Creepy. Like a horror film message to the next victim.', '2013-01-05 21:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950056, 1047484, 114225, '<td valign="top">Ah, that brings back memories f my childhood. Wish I still had one.</td>', 'Ah, that brings back memories f my childhood. Wish I still had one.', '2013-01-05 21:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950057, 1047512, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like it. Great choice in colors to squish, and the background made up of the others is great.</td>', 'I like it. Great choice in colors to squish, and the background made up of the others is great.', '2013-01-05 21:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950063, 1047491, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but I think this could really benefit from more depth of field.</td>', 'I like the idea, but I think this could really benefit from more depth of field.', '2013-01-05 21:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950064, 1046728, 114225, '<td valign="top">Love the way the light hits the paper.</td>', 'Love the way the light hits the paper.', '2013-01-05 21:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950066, 1047045, 114225, '<td valign="top">That''s a great idea for a photo. The white balance feels a bit off, but I can live with it.</td>', 'That''s a great idea for a photo. The white balance feels a bit off, but I can live with it.', '2013-01-05 21:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950070, 1047558, 114225, '<td valign="top">Love the focus and light in this.</td>', 'Love the focus and light in this.', '2013-01-05 21:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950101, 1046866, 152252, '<td valign="top">Water and clouds look amazing. Great lighting and textures on the sand. I like that you wrote "stick". Even though it''s kind of obvious for some reason it makes it really cool. Maybe because the stick isn''t really the most interesting part of the picture. Anyway a 9 from me (voted earlier).</td>', 'Water and clouds look amazing. Great lighting and textures on the sand. I like that you wrote "stick". Even though it''s kind of obvious for some reason it makes it really cool. Maybe because the stick isn''t really the most interesting part of the picture. Anyway a 9 from me (voted earlier).', '2013-01-05 22:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950271, 1046768, 157380, '<td valign="top">Strong concept, nice idea. The artist is just a little to jury-rigged for my liking, if it was wirted together instead of taped would have given higher. (7)</td>', 'Strong concept, nice idea. The artist is just a little to jury-rigged for my liking, if it was wirted together instead of taped would have given higher. (7)', '2013-01-06 08:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950272, 1047132, 157380, '<td valign="top">Nice detail of the nib, for me this would be a better image without the shadow. (9)</td>', 'Nice detail of the nib, for me this would be a better image without the shadow. (9)', '2013-01-06 08:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950274, 1046728, 157380, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured, interestingly lit, treatment is in keeping with the content and +1 for the great title. (9)</td>', 'Nicely captured, interestingly lit, treatment is in keeping with the content and +1 for the great title. (9)', '2013-01-06 08:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950275, 1047560, 157380, '<td valign="top">A good picture captures the viewer. I foundmyself looking at this one for allot longer than any other in this challange. Iphone is of course a writing implement of the new age what got me stuck was the etch A Sketch, until it dawned on me its a cover :D message could have been a something a bit more emotive, the colour treatment doesn''t enhance the image, the cropping inclused a few objects of unknown type. +2 for stopping me in my tracks while voting. (9)</td>', 'A good picture captures the viewer. I foundmyself looking at this one for allot longer than any other in this challange. Iphone is of course a writing implement of the new age what got me stuck was the etch A Sketch, until it dawned on me its a cover :D message could have been a something a bit more emotive, the colour treatment doesn''t enhance the image, the cropping inclused a few objects of unknown type. +2 for stopping me in my tracks while voting. (9)', '2013-01-06 08:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950276, 1047087, 157380, '<td valign="top">best capture of a pencil, sharpest detail most interesting lighting, water drop adds no value here for me, I''d have given the image a 10 without the water. (9)</td>', 'best capture of a pencil, sharpest detail most interesting lighting, water drop adds no value here for me, I''d have given the image a 10 without the water. (9)', '2013-01-06 08:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950277, 1047528, 157380, '<td valign="top">Nice picure, I could easily see this in a catalouge in the DIY section. Nice excecution of a well visualised image.</td>', 'Nice picure, I could easily see this in a catalouge in the DIY section. Nice excecution of a well visualised image.', '2013-01-06 08:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950278, 1047447, 157380, '<td valign="top">The image has a nice basic geometry in the elements and I love the irony of the colour ''dissonance''. I feel this would have worked better as a full depth of field image. Also I no need to go green red and blue two colours would have done the job. +1 for the Humour. (8)</td>', 'The image has a nice basic geometry in the elements and I love the irony of the colour ''dissonance''. I feel this would have worked better as a full depth of field image. Also I no need to go green red and blue two colours would have done the job. +1 for the Humour. (8)', '2013-01-06 08:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950279, 1047406, 157380, '<td valign="top">nicely captured, I would have prefered to see the part where it intersects with the unsharpened shaft though. The geometry as it is leads the viewer out the bottom of the page never to return.</td>', 'nicely captured, I would have prefered to see the part where it intersects with the unsharpened shaft though. The geometry as it is leads the viewer out the bottom of the page never to return.', '2013-01-06 08:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950280, 1047502, 157380, '<td valign="top">Nice rhythm, very cool idea, don''t think grey scale does it any favours though, a hint of colour could have gone a long way here. It''s not exactly square, but its so close to square it looks like youve tried and come up short. I''d suggest in the least rotating so the most level line is the bottom of the image as it sits I feel the pencils want to roll off the left hand side of the frame. (8)</td>', 'Nice rhythm, very cool idea, don''t think grey scale does it any favours though, a hint of colour could have gone a long way here. It''s not exactly square, but its so close to square it looks like youve tried and come up short. I''d suggest in the least rotating so the most level line is the bottom of the image as it sits I feel the pencils want to roll off the left hand side of the frame. (8)', '2013-01-06 08:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950282, 1047484, 157380, '<td valign="top">Nice tones, well lit. nicely framed. A bit static for a type writer, perhaps if one of the armatures were in missing, or in motion then that might bring a nice but dead image to life. (8)</td>', 'Nice tones, well lit. nicely framed. A bit static for a type writer, perhaps if one of the armatures were in missing, or in motion then that might bring a nice but dead image to life. (8)', '2013-01-06 08:37:45.000000', NULL, 1);
