(6950287, 1047521, 157380, '<td valign="top">what I like most about this picture is that it brings includes paper in the equation. no idea what that strange star shape is. Jus the pen, paper, and ink line would have scored a 10 from me. (8)</td>', 'what I like most about this picture is that it brings includes paper in the equation. no idea what that strange star shape is. Jus the pen, paper, and ink line would have scored a 10 from me. (8)', '2013-01-06 08:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950291, 1047397, 157380, '<td valign="top">lovely pen. Nicely lit and composed. Is it a cartridge pen? Doesn''t look like the results from any dipping pen I''ve seen or used. (8)</td>', 'lovely pen. Nicely lit and composed. Is it a cartridge pen? Doesn''t look like the results from any dipping pen I''ve seen or used. (8)', '2013-01-06 08:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950293, 1047195, 157380, '<td valign="top">lovely idea and composition. Would have liked better if lighting was setup as for a chrome/glass product shoot.</td>', 'lovely idea and composition. Would have liked better if lighting was setup as for a chrome/glass product shoot.', '2013-01-06 08:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
