(6950306, 1047491, 157380, '<td valign="top">concept cool, title raising my interest nicely. Image is Under-exposed and the elements of the picture like what was on hand. if the pen were tilting just to the right of the text, as if the statement has just been written would be a bit more suggestive of casual contemplation thereby ccommunicating the intent better than the collection of objects you have arranged here. (6)</td>', 'concept cool, title raising my interest nicely. Image is Under-exposed and the elements of the picture like what was on hand. if the pen were tilting just to the right of the text, as if the statement has just been written would be a bit more suggestive of casual contemplation thereby ccommunicating the intent better than the collection of objects you have arranged here. (6)', '2013-01-06 08:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
