(6989694, 1047397, 129807, '<td valign="top">I too had this pegged for a ribbon. Gave it a 10 at the time. This image seems to encapsulate all the good things about hand written correspondence that seem to be lacking in this computer oriented world we live in now. Very traditional and neat penmanship too works well with the style. Lovely.</td>', 'I too had this pegged for a ribbon. Gave it a 10 at the time. This image seems to encapsulate all the good things about hand written correspondence that seem to be lacking in this computer oriented world we live in now. Very traditional and neat penmanship too works well with the style. Lovely.', '2013-03-02 19:30:53.000000', NULL, 0),
